  "title": "Snap Video Compression",
  "summary": "Compression is broadly used across web and mobile applications, and Snap is no exception. Video compression is one of the core technical considerations at Snap. It enables our users to share and enjoy the moments in daily lives. In this post we’ll talk a bit about the fundamentals of compression, and then describe how we’ve recently invested in improving compression for video to achieve performant, high quality results.",
